### Single review
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The pasta was delicious and arrived hot. Will order again!"
}

### Negative review
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Terrible packaging. The food was cold and the fries were soggy."
}

### Batch
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "texts": [
    "Loved the spicy ramen. Fast delivery and the noodles were perfect.",
    "Wrong order twice in a row. Refund took forever."
  ]
}

### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
